 "words_heard": 237,
 "words": 243,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Fifty days from Passover they gathered in one place",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A sound came down from heaven like a wind to fill the air",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Tongues as of fire were dividing, one on every head",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They were all filled with the Holy Spirit, speaking as the Spirit led",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I will pour out my Spirit on all flesh",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Your sons and your daughters will prophesy",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Your young men will see visions",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And your old men will dream dreams",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Everyone who calls on the name of the Lord will be saved",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Parthians and Medes and Elamites, from Egypt and from Rome",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Each heard the mighty works of God in the language of his home",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Some were amazed and others mocked, they are full of new wine",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then Peter stood up with the eleven and he raised his voice on high",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "This Jesus God has raised up",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.08,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And of that we are all witnesses",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Repent and be baptized, every one of you",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And you will receive the gift of the Holy Spirit",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The promise is for you and for your children",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And for all who are far off",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I will pour out my Spirit on all flesh",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Your sons and your daughters will prophesy",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Your young men will see visions",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And your old men will dream dreams",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Everyone who calls on the name of the Lord will be saved",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "About three thousand souls were added that day",
   "heard": 6,
